85:### T11 — Margin bar field (every state a bar, margin as dotted extension)
86-- **Timestamps:** 2:37–2:52
87-- **Mechanics:** All states become vertical bars in winner colour; above each solid bar, a dotted column extension shows the losing side's share — "no state is actually all-red or all-blue" (transcript 2:36). Operation: bar growth + dotted extension; input margin is drawn, per state, before any allocation is discussed (the P-A2 triple: margin → allocation → tally, captured in that order across T11–T13).
88-- **Why it works:** This is the film's honesty device: the margin is made visible as physical stuff first, so its erasure in T13 is something the viewer has seen, not something they are told.
